	"identifying_description": "A kayak model with kayaker rendered in Greenlandic style. The kayak is a solid wood form with what appears to be black skin stretched over it, however the skin may be simulated hide. Deck fittings and implements are of wood and ivory. The kayaker is carved from wood and wears a muslin parka. He holds an ivory paddle.",
